  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C /220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato, carrot and beetroot into 1 cm chunks. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63c8e479e408622c6b0efd90/step-bcfc1c61.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 25-30 minutes. TIP: Beetroot stays firm when cooked. It's done when you can pierce it with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63c8e479e408622c6b0efd90/step-f895eb18.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• In a medium bowl combine haloumi, ras el hanout and a drizzle of olive oil. Turn haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63c8e479e408622c6b0efd90/step-3145caed.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Remove from the heat and add the honey to the pan and toss to coat.\n• Transfer to a plate and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63c8e479e408622c6b0efd90/step-80828468.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the roast veggie tray, add baby spinach leaves and a drizzle of white wine vinegar.\n• Season to taste. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63c8e479e408622c6b0efd90/step-f6d4ba34.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roast veggie toss between bowls.\n• Crumble fetta cubes over the veggies, then top with ras el hanout haloumi.\n• Serve with garlic sauce. Enjoy! Little cooks: Add the finishing touch by dolloping over the garlic sauce!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63c8e479e408622c6b0efd90/step-28ffbb5e.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
